WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Amanzi emvula ehla ophahleni angene emseleni.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Inetha libamba amaqabunga, amanzi adlule.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Amanzi okuqala anothuli agcwalisa ipayipi elimile.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Ibhola liyenyuka livale ipayipi, amanzi angene ethangini elivaliwe.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Uma ithangi ligcwele, amanzi achichimela emgodini wesihlahla, kude nodonga.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Uma imvula isidlulile, thulula ipayipi ukuze lilungele imvula elandelayo.
